ardInternalId` in `ActionContext`; `ActionPopup` already subscribes to project state, where the matching card exposes its user-facing `header.id`. Project-agent popups use context kind `project`.\\ndesign\\\\releases\\\\0_1_0\\\\F_110_card_action_popup_should_show_card_id.md:34:- Every card action popup visibly shows its card ID in the header.\\ndesign\\\\releases\\\\0_0_3\\\\F_76_action_streaming_or_oneshot_agent_mode.md:16:- `handleClose()` is the only terminal path: persists conversation, releases `runningConversationIds`, calls `onComplete`.\\ndesign\\\\releases\\\\0_0_3\\\\F_76_action_streaming_or_oneshot_agent_mode.md:56:  - `runningConversationIds` guard, conversation persistence, and `onComplete` all hang off `handleClose`; each needs a streaming-aware trigger.\\ndesign\\\\releases\\\\0_0_3\\\\F_76_action_streaming_or_oneshot_agent_mode.md:74:- Long-lived child processes: leaks, zombie `runningConversationIds`, cancel semantics on app quit.\\ndesign\\\\releases\\\\0_2_0\\\\card__05d5d49c-401f-42cd-b3cc-074e169631dd.json:38:          \\\"type\\\": \\\"reasoning\\\"\\ndesign\\\\releases\\\\0_2_0\\\\card__05d5d49c-401f-42cd-b3cc-074e169631dd.json:110:          \\\"type\\\": \\\"reasoning\\\"\\ndesign\\\\releases\\\\0_2_0\\\\card__05d5d49c-401f-42cd-b3cc-074e169631dd.json:146:          \\\"output\\\": \\\"1\\\\t---\\\\n2\\\\tauthor: \\\\n3\\\\tid: F_153\\\\n4\\\\tinternalId: 05d5d49c-401f-42cd-b3cc-074e169631dd\\\\n5\\\\ttitle: action part in approval required\\\\n6\\\\tstatus: design\\\\n7\\\\towner: \\\\n8\\\\taffects:\\\\n9\\\\tagents:\\\\n10\\\\t  - design/activity/card__05d5d49c-401f-42cd-b3cc-074e169631dd.json#conversation=agent-2322e64a-9c75-4d08-b6cd-9b3d966b498b\\\\n11\\\\t  - design/activity/card__05d5d49c-401f-42cd-b3cc-074e169631dd.json#conversation=agent-793ef4cc-80b6-453e-a264-fc5869fdf065\\\\n12\\\\tpolicy:\\\\n13\\\\t---\\\\n14\\\\tThis is the text shown in the drawer shown when an agent requests for approval:\\\\n15\\\\t\\\\n16\\\\t> Approval re