ample Ã¢â‚¬â€ \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Why React component re-render?\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- lite: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Your component re-renders because you create a new object reference each render. Wrap it in `useMemo`.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- full: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"New object ref each render. Inline object prop = new ref = re-render. Wrap in `useMemo`.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- ultra: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Inline obj prop, new ref, re-render. `useMemo`.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- wenyan-lite: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Ã§Âµâ€žÃ¤Â»Â¶Ã©Â Â»Ã©â€¡ÂÃ§Â¹ÂªÃ¯Â¼Å’Ã¤Â»Â¥Ã¦Â¯ÂÃ§Â¹ÂªÃ¦â€“Â°Ã§â€Å¸Ã¥Â°ÂÃ¨Â±Â¡Ã¥ÂÆ’Ã§â€¦Â§Ã¦â€¢â€¦Ã£â‚¬â€šÃ¤Â»Â¥ useMemo Ã¥Å’â€¦Ã¤Â¹â€¹Ã£â‚¬â€š\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- wenyan-full: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Ã¦Â¯ÂÃ§Â¹ÂªÃ¦â€“Â°Ã§â€Å¸Ã¥Â°ÂÃ¨Â±Â¡Ã¥ÂÆ’Ã§â€¦Â§Ã¯Â¼Å’Ã¦â€¢â€¦Ã©â€¡ÂÃ§Â¹ÂªÃ¯Â¼â€ºÃ¤Â»Â¥ useMemo Ã¥Å’â€¦Ã¤Â¹â€¹Ã¥â€°â€¡Ã¥â€¦ÂÃ£â‚¬â€š\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- wenyan-ultra: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Ã¦â€“Â°Ã¥ÂÆ’Ã§â€¦Â§Ã¥â€°â€¡Ã©â€¡ÂÃ§Â¹ÂªÃ£â‚¬â€šuseMemo Ã¥Å’â€¦Ã¤Â¹â€¹Ã£â‚¬â€š\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nExample Ã¢â‚¬â€ \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Explain database connection pooling.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- lite: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Connection pooling reuses open connections instead of creating new ones per request. Avoids repeated handshake overhead.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- full: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Pool reuse open DB connections. No new connection per request. Skip handshake overhead.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- ultra: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Pool reuse open DB connections. No per-request handshake.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n- wenyan-full: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\